#: parabolas.cpp:333
msgid ""
"The given parabola has the <font color = red><b>two</b></font> "
"intersection-points with the x-axis"
"<br><b>Sx<sub>1</sub>( %1 | 0 )</b> and <b>Sx<sub>1</sub>( %2 | 0 )</b> "
"and with the y-axis the intersection-point <b>Sy( 0 | %3 )</b>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:344
msgid ""
"The given parabola has only <font color = red><b>one</b></font> "
"intersection-point with the x-axis"
"<br><b>Sx( %1 | 0 )</b> and with the y-axis the intersection-point"
"<br> <b>Sy( 0 | %2 )</b>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:385
msgid ""
"<b>The function determined by the three given points <font color = red>"
"is not a parabola.</font></b>"
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:395
msgid ""
"<b>The function determined by the three given points <font color = red>"
"is not a parabola but a line.</font></b>"
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:432
msgid ""
"The equation of the parabola, that runs through the three given points is:"
"<br><b><i>%1</i></b>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:457
msgid ""
"<b>The function determined by the turn point and point <font color = red>"
"is not a parabola.</font></b>"
"<br>Maybe the vertex is identical to the second point?"
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:468
msgid ""
"<b>The function determined by the turn point and point <font color = red>"
"is not a parabola  but a line.</font></b>"
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:505
msgid ""
"The equation of the parabola, that runs through the turn point and point is:"
"<br>Y = <b><i>%1</i></b>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:536
msgid "The given parabola and line <font color = red>do not intersect.</font>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:547
msgid ""
"There is <b>one intersection-point</b> of the parabola and the line at"
"<br><b><i>S(%1|%2)</i></b>."
"<br>So the line is a <b>tangent</b> to the parabola."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:564
msgid ""
"There are <b>two intersection-points</b> of the parabola and the line at"
"<br><b><i>S<sub>1</sub>(%1|%2)</i></b> and <b><i>S<sub>2</sub>(%3|%4)</i></b>."
"<br>So the line and the parabola do <b>intersect</b>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:590
msgid "The two given parabolas <font color = red>do not intersect.</font>."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:601
msgid ""
"There is <b>one intersection-point</b> of the two parabolas at"
"<br><b><i>S(%1|%2)</i></b>."
"<br>So the two parabolas are <b>tangent</b> to each other at the intersection "
"point."
msgstr ""

#: parabolas.cpp:618
msgid ""
"There are <b>two intersection-points</b> of the two parabolas at"
"<br><b><i>S<sub>1</sub>(%1|%2)</i></b> and <b><i>S<sub>2</sub>(%3|%4)</i></b>."
"<br>So the line and the parabola do <b>intersect</b>."
msgstr ""

